message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite both the software and the accompanying paper."
title: "AI Governance Discourse: Capability vs Consequence (2019-2026)"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, CPU-only computational text-analysis pipeline that codes
  global AI-governance documents into a "capability" frame and a "consequence"
  frame and tracks how their balance shifts over time, interpreted through
  Guenther Anders' theory of the Promethean gap.
